- agent: agent-c
- branch: agent/c/m4-w4-sdk
- task: TASK-068
- summary: |
    Wired Layer 2 Rti1516eAmbassador (IEEE 1516-2010 / HLA Evolved
    standard-shaped sync callback API). Internally owns a private
    asyncio event loop running on a daemon thread; sync calls schedule
    their async equivalents via asyncio.run_coroutine_threadsafe and
    block on the resulting concurrent.futures.Future.

    Method mapping (Layer 2 -> Layer 1):
      - connect / disconnect           -> RtiConnection.__aenter__/__aexit__
      - createFederationExecution      -> stash spec for next join
      - joinFederationExecution        -> RtiConnection.join_federation(...)
                                          + start _pump_events() task
      - resignFederationExecution      -> federate __aexit__, cancel pump
      - publish/subscribe/register/    -> Federate.{publish,subscribe,
        update/send/time methods           register,update,send,enable,
                                          next_message_request}
      - _pump_events()                 -> drains Federate.events() and
                                          dispatches each event dataclass
                                          to the matching callback on
                                          the registered target

    Spec test surface check passes; agent-owned
    pysdk/tests/test_standard_ambassador.py adds two end-to-end tests:
    full lifecycle delegation (every call recorded against the fake)
    and callback dispatch (push events through the fake, observe
    overridden callbacks fire on the subclass).
- acceptance:
    - pytest pysdk/tests/spec/m4/test_spec_m4_standard_ambassador.py: 2/2 GREEN
    - pytest pysdk/tests/test_standard_ambassador.py: 2/2 GREEN
    - mypy --strict pysdk: clean
    - ruff check pysdk: clean
